    <!-- BIOGRAPHY -->
    <div class="about-intro">
      <p>
        I am a filmmaker and videographer from Sumba, based in Kupang,
        East Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia. Since 2018, I have worked in
        film and audiovisual production, with experience in directing,
        producing, and documentary filmmaking.
      </p>
      <p>
        My documentary work focuses on social and environmental issues,
        cultural heritage, and the everyday lives of local communities.
        I am also involved in Komunitas Film Kupang and the Flobamora
        Film Festival.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside my independent film practice, I am developing
        Kenpatar Films, a production initiative focused on documentary
        filmmaking and audiovisual production.
      </p>
    </div>

